	(text "Low-side heater stage: VOUT_12V -> R1(10k) / R2(10k) divider sets VGS~=6V on Q1 (keeps within VGS_max of AO3400-class FETs even on VOUT spikes). F1 -> H1 heater harness -> Q1 series path. H1 also carries heater NTC to RX_NTC."
